Package: mini-search
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, zlib1g
Maintainer: nekam13 <https://github.com/nekam13/mini-search>
Homepage: https://github.com/nekam13/mini-search
Description: Hybridni vyhledavac s lokalnim indexem
 Mini Search crawluje weby, sitemapy, RSS/Atom a ceskou Wikipedii do SQLite
 s FTS5 a hleda hybridne (fulltext + volitelne vektorove). Bezi cely lokalne,
 bez uctu a bez cloudu.
